# The builder stage runs `COPY . .`, so anything here would land in a builder
# layer, and the release build exports builder layers to the Actions cache.
# The checkout's .git/config can hold the job's token, and an untracked secret
# in a working tree would otherwise be copied in too.
#
# Do not exclude bpf/.generated/ or internal/ebpf/embedded/*.bpf.o: the build
# reads the BTF header and the prebuilt BPF objects from the context.
.git
.github
bin/
/podtrace
/bundle/
/dist/
/release/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.test
*.prof
*.out
*.coverprofile
test-report.txt
test_output.log
.idea/
.vscode/
